'''Forgotten Republic''' (忘却共和国 ''Bōkyaku Kyōwakoku'', '''Forgotten Republic''') is the 25th sub-chapter of [[Zero Legends]], and the 123rd sub-chapter overall. It was introduced in [[Version 14.7 Update|Version 14.7]] and is available up to {{1c}} difficulty.

==Difficulty==
Similar to the previous Zero Legends sub-chapter [[Sleeping Chasm]], while the difficulty has generally increased, most of the stages fall to simple techniques. The hardest stages here are the last two stages, with [[Awash with Spare Keys]] featuring a combination between [[Commander Ostromeda]] and [[Deathshund]], and [[Motley Assembly]] being a [[No Return Flights]]-like stage with a deadly synergy between [[M. Ost]] and [[Shachiko]].

==New Features==
This sub-chapter introduces 1 new enemy:
*[[Deathshund]]: A [[:Category:Zombie Enemies|Zombie]] variant of [[Dagshund]]. Still tanky like the original and doesn't attack as frequently, but has very long range for a Zombie and a 900-distance burrow, revives once with 100% HP and freezes cats for 2 seconds.

